name japanese-otf
category Package
revision 64072
shortdesc Advanced font selection for platex and its friends
longdesc The package contains pLaTeX support files and virtual fonts for
longdesc supporting a wide variety of fonts in LaTeX using the pTeX
longdesc engine.
